rule research v1
description "How far the research has come. Hand-written code puts next_progress back into progress the next season"

inputs
  progress : number  range >=0 <=200  fed by rulec "research.rule" output next_progress
  learning : number  range >=0 <=100

outputs
  learned : bool
  next_progress : number  round down(1)

derive total : number = progress + learning  range >=0 <=300

table finish
policy unique
| total | -> learned : bool | next_progress : number |
| >=100 | true              | 0                      |
| <100  | false             | 50                     |
